<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear list for Discipline Priest Healer in Wrath of the Lich King Classic for Phase 4. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from Heroics, reputation rewards, and the new 10-man Raid loot added to Titan Rune Dungeons.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot-gear">Discipline Priest Healer Best in Slot Gear, Gems, and Enchants - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>While they are definitely not required for setting foot in your first raid, there are a handful of highly valueable items and bonuses you can aim for to catch up to the current tier of raiding as soon as possible. <br/>
<br/>Among these, the most noteworthy ones are the two new crafted items and the T8 4p set which will serve you well into phase 4, but even other items like the rings, necklace and trinkets listed in the embed below are exceptionally powerful in spite of being available pre-raid.<br/>
<br/>Although you will and also should realistically begin raiding before assembling the set below, you will most certainly be geared enough to heal any raid of the current tier on heroic difficulty without any problems using this gearset.<br/>
<br/>
