<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_26.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandals of Consecration</span></a></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>3</td>
<td>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47587/royal-moonshroud-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Royal Moonshroud Bracers</span></a></td>
<td>
<a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=197/tailoring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_tailoring.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tailoring</span></a> Crafted <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67065/royal-moonshroud-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Royal Moonshroud Bracers</span></a></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>4</td>
<td>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50182/blood-queens-crimson-choker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_crimsonspinel_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blood Queen's Crimson Choker</span></a></td>
<td>
<a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=37955/blood-queen-lanathel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Blood-Queen Lana'thel</span></a> - <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> 25N</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>5</td>
<td>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45558/cord-of-the-white-dawn">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_40b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of the White Dawn</span></a></td>
<td>
<a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=197/tailoring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_tailoring.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tailoring</span></a> Crafted <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=63205/cord-of-the-white-dawn">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_40b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of the White Dawn</span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<br/>
<br/>Given Discipline primarily gears for spell power, naturally there are a few high item lvl BoE items that can be worth picking up if your goal is to catch up to the current tier as soon as possible. With <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49908/primordial-saronite">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_felflamebreath.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Primordial Saronite</span></a> being obtainable through Defense Protocol Gamma dungeons now, the new crafted items won't be all that hard to get either. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49892/lightweave-leggings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightweave Leggings</span></a> is an incredible item to use alongside your T8 4p (or T10 4p later on) and is not much worse than the strongest offpiece options from the new raid tier. All in all, well worth the cost.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49893/sandals-of-consecration">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_26.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandals of Consecration</span></a> is superior to every other item in this slot besides the highly contested <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50699/plague-scientists-boots">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_24.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Plague Scientist's Boots</span></a>, which will likely go to your caster DPS first. Even though <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51850/pale-corpse-boots">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_27.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pale Corpse Boots</span></a> from 10-man heroic <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> is a sidegrade to this pair of boots, getting them crafted as soon as possible is definitely still the way to go.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47587/royal-moonshroud-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Royal Moonshroud Bracers</span></a> is the pair of bracers most priests are still using going into Phase 4, so realistically they will last you until you obtain <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51918/bracers-of-dark-blessings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_47.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Dark Blessings</span></a> from 10-man <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> on heroic difficulty.<br/>
<br/>Although <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50182/blood-queens-crimson-choker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_crimsonspinel_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blood Queen's Crimson Choker</span></a> is a sizable upgrade over the other available pre-bis options, it's likely going to be quite expensive. Unless you're certain that it's within your budget, it's recommend to simply stick to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45933/pendant-of-the-shallow-grave">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of the Shallow Grave</span></a> until you can get one of the many <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> necklaces.<br/>
<br/>Finally, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45558/cord-of-the-white-dawn">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_40b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of the White Dawn</span></a> is only slightly inferior to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47081/cord-of-biting-cold">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of Biting Cold</span></a> and should be quite affordable by now. Choosing it allows you to stop farming <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2711/defilers-scourgestone">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Defiler's Scourgestone</span></span></a>
<span class="q1">
<ins>s</ins></span> sooner.<br/>
<br/>Nonetheless, grinding out pieces of gear for every slot in the Titan Rune dungeons will likely be more worthwhile than spending your gold on these pieces and neglecting the rest of your gear, so carefully consider whether or not you want to opt for them.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-gems">Best Gems for Discipline Priest Healer - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Meta Socket - <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41401/insightful-earthsiege-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_shadowspirit_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Insightful Earthsiege Diamond</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Red Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40113/runed-cardinal-ruby">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runed Cardinal Ruby</span></a> &gt; <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=39998/runed-scarlet-ruby">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_28.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runed Scarlet Ruby</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Blue Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40134/royal-dreadstone">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Royal Dreadstone</span></a> &gt; <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40027/royal-twilight-opal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_29.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Royal Twilight Opal</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Yellow Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40151/luminous-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Luminous Ametrine</span></a> &gt; <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40047/luminous-monarch-topaz">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Luminous Monarch Topaz</span></a></div></li></ul>With <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41401/insightful-earthsiege-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_shadowspirit_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Insightful Earthsiege Diamond</span></a> providing a large amount of mana regeneration at the opportunity cost of fairly little spell power, it's your go-to meta choice for the rest of the expansion.<br/>As such, you will always want to use one purple and one orange gem to meet the requirements of the meta gem and purely use red spell power gems outside of that.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-enchants">Best Enchants for Discipline Priest Healer - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Head - <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50368/arcanum-of-burning-mysteries">
