<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Shoulder - <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50338/greater-inscription-of-the-storm">
