<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Waist - <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41611/eternal-belt-buckle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_36.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eternal Belt Buckle</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Wrist - <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=57691/fur-lining-spell-power">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fur Lining - Spell Power</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60767/enchant-bracers-superior-spellpower">
